  "created": "2026-02-08T00:35:29.903Z",
  "description": "🚀 THE KILLER FEATURE: Copy and paste any curl command - it just works!\n\nCurlDotNet brings the power of curl to .NET. Simply paste any curl command string and execute it directly. No translation needed, no shell execution, pure .NET.\n\n✨ Key Features:\n• Paste ANY curl command - works with or without \"curl\" prefix\n• All 300+ curl options supported\n• Stream-based for memory efficiency\n• Perfect for CI/CD pipelines\n• Every curl error code has its own exception type\n• Middleware and DI support\n\n📦 Supported Platforms:\n• .NET 10.0 (future-ready, opt-in support!)\n• .NET 9.0 (latest & greatest!)\n• .NET 8.0 (current LTS)\n• .NET Framework 4.8 (Windows, Mac, Linux via Mono)\n• .NET Framework 4.7.2+ (Windows)\n• .NET Standard 2.0 (maximum compatibility)\n• Xamarin, Unity, Blazor, MAUI\n\n💎 Proudly sponsored by IronSoftware (ironsoftware.com), creators of IronPDF, IronOCR, IronXL, and IronBarcode.",
